{"seq":3,"slug":"provide-inject","title":"provide/inject 依赖注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/provide-inject","wordCount":570,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"provide-inject-依赖注入\">provide/inject 依赖注入</h1><h2 id=\"依赖注入概述\">依赖注入概述</h2><p>Vue 3 的 <code>provide</code> / <code>inject</code> 机制实现了组件树中的<strong>依赖注入</strong>模式，允许祖先组件向所有后代组件提供数据，无需通过 props 逐层传递。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph PropDrilling[&quot;Props 逐层传递(Prop Drilling)&quot;]&#10;        PA[&quot;父组件 (data)&quot;] --&gt; |props| CA[&quot;中间组件&quot;]&#10;        CA --&gt; |props| GA[&quot;目标组件&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ProvideInject[&quot;provide / inject&quot;]&#10;        PB[&quot;祖先组件 (provide)&quot;] --&gt; |inject| GB[&quot;任意后代组件&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph PropDrilling[\"Props 逐层传递(Prop Drilling)\"]\n        PA[\"父组件 (data)\"] --&gt; |props| CA[\"中间组件\"]\n        CA --&gt; |props| GA[\"目标组件\"]\n    end\n    subgraph ProvideInject[\"provide / inject\"]\n        PB[\"祖先组件 (provide)\"] --&gt; |inject| GB[\"任意后代组件\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>依赖注入</strong>：祖先组件声明「提供什么」，任意后代组件声明「需要什么」，双方不直接认识彼此。</li>\n<li><strong>prop drilling</strong>：逐层透传 props 的反模式，provide/inject 正是为消除它而生。</li>\n<li><strong>InjectionKey</strong>：以 <code>Symbol</code> 承载的注入键，配合 <code>InjectionKey&lt;T&gt;</code> 在 TypeScript 中给出完整类型推断。</li>\n<li><strong>默认值</strong>：注入可以是可选的，通过直接值或工厂函数（第三个参数为 <code>true</code>）提供缺省，避免 <code>undefined</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>单向数据流</strong>：注入的响应式数据后代可读，但修改逻辑应由提供方一并提供，常用 <code>readonly</code> 强制约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h2><h3 id=\"provide\">provide</h3><p>祖先组件通过 <code>provide</code> 提供数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { provide, ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const theme = ref&lt;&#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39;&gt;(&#39;light&#39;);&#10;const toggleTheme = () =&gt; {&#10;  theme.value = theme.value === &#39;light&#39; ? &#39;dark&#39; : &#39;light&#39;;&#10;};&#10;&#10;provide(&#39;theme&#39;, theme);&#10;provide(&#39;toggleTheme&#39;, toggleTheme);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { provide, ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const theme = ref&#x3C;'light' | 'dark'>('light');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const toggleTheme = () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme.value = theme.value === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide('theme', theme);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide('toggleTheme', toggleTheme);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"inject\">inject</h3><p>后代组件通过 <code>inject</code> 接收数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { inject, type Ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const theme = inject&lt;Ref&lt;&#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39;&gt;&gt;(&#39;theme&#39;);&#10;const toggleTheme = inject&lt;() =&gt; void&gt;(&#39;toggleTheme&#39;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div :class=&quot;theme&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;button @click=&quot;toggleTheme&quot;&gt;切换主题&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { inject, type Ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const theme = inject&#x3C;Ref&#x3C;'light' | 'dark'>>('theme');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const toggleTheme = inject&#x3C;() => void>('toggleTheme');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div :class=\"theme\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button @click=\"toggleTheme\">切换主题&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型安全的注入\">类型安全的注入</h2><p>使用 <code>InjectionKey</code> 可以在 TypeScript 中实现完整的类型推断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// keys.ts&#10;import type { InjectionKey, Ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;export interface UserContext {&#10;  user: Ref&lt;{ name: string; role: string } | null&gt;;&#10;  login: (name: string) =&gt; void;&#10;  logout: () =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export const UserKey: InjectionKey&lt;UserContext&gt; = Symbol(&#39;user&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// keys.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { InjectionKey, Ref } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  login</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  logout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UserKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InjectionKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UserContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Symbol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 祖先组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { provide, ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import { UserKey, type UserContext } from &#39;@/keys&#39;;&#10;&#10;const user = ref&lt;{ name: string; role: string } | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;const userContext: UserContext = {&#10;  user,&#10;  login(name: string) {&#10;    user.value = { name, role: &#39;user&#39; };&#10;  },&#10;  logout() {&#10;    user.value = null;&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;provide(UserKey, userContext);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 祖先组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { provide, ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { UserKey, type UserContext } from '@/keys';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const user = ref&#x3C;{ name: string; role: string } | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const userContext: UserContext = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  login(name: string) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user.value = { name, role: 'user' };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  logout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user.value = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide(UserKey, userContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 后代组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { inject } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import { UserKey } from &#39;@/keys&#39;;&#10;&#10;const userCtx = inject(UserKey);&#10;// TypeScript 自动推断出 UserContext | undefined 类型&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 后代组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { inject } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { UserKey } from '@/keys';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const userCtx = inject(UserKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// TypeScript 自动推断出 UserContext | undefined 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"注入默认值\">注入默认值</h2><p>当注入的值可能不存在时，提供默认值避免 <code>undefined</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 简单默认值&#10;const theme = inject(&#39;theme&#39;, &#39;light&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 工厂函数默认值（避免每次创建新对象）&#10;const config = inject(&#10;  &#39;config&#39;,&#10;  () =&gt; ({&#10;    apiUrl: &#39;/api&#39;,&#10;    timeout: 5000,&#10;  }),&#10;  true,&#10;); // 第三个参数 true 表示使用工厂函数&#10;&#10;// 使用 InjectionKey 时的默认值&#10;const userCtx = inject(UserKey, {&#10;  user: ref(null),&#10;  login: () =&gt; {},&#10;  logout: () =&gt; {},&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 简单默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> theme</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'theme'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'light'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 工厂函数默认值（避免每次创建新对象）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    apiUrl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    timeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 第三个参数 true 表示使用工厂函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 InjectionKey 时的默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userCtx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserKey, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  user: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  login</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  logout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>默认值方式</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接值</td>\n<td>基本类型默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工厂函数</td>\n<td>对象/数组默认值，避免引用共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不提供默认值</td>\n<td>必须由祖先提供，否则开发警告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"响应式注入\">响应式注入</h2><p><code>provide</code> 的值如果是响应式的（ref / reactive），后代组件注入后同样保持响应性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 祖先组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { provide, reactive } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const appConfig = reactive({&#10;  locale: &#39;zh-CN&#39;,&#10;  currency: &#39;CNY&#39;,&#10;  dateFormat: &#39;YYYY-MM-DD&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;provide(&#39;appConfig&#39;, appConfig);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 祖先组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { provide, reactive } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const appConfig = reactive({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  locale: 'zh-CN',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  currency: 'CNY',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dateFormat: 'YYYY-MM-DD',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide('appConfig', appConfig);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[&quot;provide(key, reactiveData)&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; C1[&quot;inject(key) - 组件 A&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; C2[&quot;inject(key) - 组件 B&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; C3[&quot;inject(key) - 组件 C&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; |响应式连接| P&#10;    C2 --&gt; |响应式连接| P&#10;    C3 --&gt; |响应式连接| P\">flowchart TD\n    P[\"provide(key, reactiveData)\"]\n    P --&gt; C1[\"inject(key) - 组件 A\"]\n    P --&gt; C2[\"inject(key) - 组件 B\"]\n    P --&gt; C3[\"inject(key) - 组件 C\"]\n    C1 --&gt; |响应式连接| P\n    C2 --&gt; |响应式连接| P\n    C3 --&gt; |响应式连接| P</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 为了保持单向数据流，建议将修改逻辑也通过 <code>provide</code> 提供，而不是让后代直接修改注入的响应式数据。可以使用 <code>readonly</code> 包裹注入的数据来强制执行这一原则。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { provide, ref, readonly } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;&#10;provide(&#39;count&#39;, readonly(count));&#10;provide(&#39;incrementCount&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  count.value++;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { provide, ref, readonly } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">provide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readonly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">provide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'incrementCount'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  count.value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"应用级-provide\">应用级 provide</h2><p>在应用入口使用 <code>app.provide</code> 可以为整个应用的所有组件提供数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts&#10;import { createApp } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import App from &#39;./App.vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = createApp(App);&#10;&#10;app.provide(&#39;appVersion&#39;, &#39;2.0.0&#39;);&#10;app.provide(&#39;apiBaseUrl&#39;, import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL);&#10;&#10;app.mount(&#39;#app&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createApp } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> App </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './App.vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(App);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">provide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'appVersion'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">provide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apiBaseUrl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">VITE_API_URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战模式-组合-provide-inject-与-composable\">实战模式：组合 provide/inject 与 composable</h2><p>将 <code>provide</code> / <code>inject</code> 封装为一对 composable，提供更好的 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// composables/useDialog.ts&#10;import { provide, inject, ref, type InjectionKey, type Ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface DialogContext {&#10;  visible: Ref&lt;boolean&gt;;&#10;  title: Ref&lt;string&gt;;&#10;  open: (title: string) =&gt; void;&#10;  close: () =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const DialogKey: InjectionKey&lt;DialogContext&gt; = Symbol(&#39;dialog&#39;);&#10;&#10;export function provideDialog(): DialogContext {&#10;  const visible = ref&lt;boolean&gt;(false);&#10;  const title = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const ctx: DialogContext = {&#10;    visible,&#10;    title,&#10;    open(t: string) {&#10;      title.value = t;&#10;      visible.value = true;&#10;    },&#10;    close() {&#10;      visible.value = false;&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  provide(DialogKey, ctx);&#10;  return ctx;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function useDialog(): DialogContext {&#10;  const ctx = inject(DialogKey);&#10;  if (!ctx) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;useDialog 必须在 provideDialog 的后代组件中使用&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  return ctx;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// composables/useDialog.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { provide, inject, ref, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> InjectionKey, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ref } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DialogCont